{"id":"n74755-2-8","stage":5,"title":"전염 · 感染","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74755-2-8-1","ko":"나는 우는 사람을 보면 나도 모르게 눈물이 나와.","zh":"我只要看到别人哭，就会不知不觉地跟着流泪。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"우는","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우는","audio":"/audio/6d91c6c909e425c774df.mp3"}},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람을","audio":"/audio/e4ea86ef494eafea0006.mp3"}},{"text":"보면","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보면","audio":"/audio/35629c9db8f201235337.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"모르게","meaning":"不知不觉","explanation":"모르다：不知不觉；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"8","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르게","audio":"/audio/24b23d321148f26a5eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"눈물이","meaning":"眼泪，泪水","explanation":"눈물：眼泪，泪水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈물","audio":"/audio/591f11d8b2394fcfd2e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55290","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈물이","audio":"/audio/0f2d3ecedafa806a9d5b.mp3"}},{"text":"나와.","meaning":"流出，漏出，涌出","explanation":"나오다：流出，漏出，涌出；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"9","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와","audio":"/audio/3e680d9cb0a070926232.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知不觉","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"在无意中不自觉地做出某种行为或说出某种话。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"591f11d8b2394fcf","term":"눈물","zh":"眼泪，泪水","audio":"/audio/591f11d8b2394fcfd2e6.mp3","entryId":"55290","definition":"从人或动物的眼里流出来的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["눈물"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"流出，漏出，涌出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"液体或气体等从里面流到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d1072142af2f1e7d95e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74755-2-8-2","ko":"나도. 슬픔은 다른 사람에게 전염이 빠른 것 같아.","zh":"我也是。悲伤好像很容易传染给别人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도.","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"슬픔은","meaning":"伤心，悲伤，悲痛，悲哀","explanation":"슬픔：伤心，悲伤，悲痛，悲哀；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"슬픔","audio":"/audio/eb2c2921b87b169aead5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65104","senseId":"1","lemma":"슬픔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"슬픔은","audio":"/audio/f862b673f902226dfd26.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사람에게","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람에게","audio":"/audio/d740a3c3d3a8a5c9c386.mp3"}},{"text":"전염이","meaning":"感染","explanation":"전염：感染；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전염","audio":"/audio/b1e500d3af46f7a378ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74755","senseId":"2","lemma":"전염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전염이","audio":"/audio/c7311dcd1b732c60b719.mp3"}},{"text":"빠른","meaning":"快，快速，迅速","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速，迅速；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"3","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠른","audio":"/audio/663bd437eaa20c8f72de.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"eb2c2921b87b169a","term":"슬픔","zh":"伤心，悲伤，悲痛，悲哀","audio":"/audio/eb2c2921b87b169aead5.mp3","entryId":"65104","definition":"心痛或痛苦的感觉。","pronunciation":["슬픔"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b1e500d3af46f7a3","term":"전염","zh":"感染","audio":"/audio/b1e500d3af46f7a378ef.mp3","entryId":"74755","definition":"受别人的习惯、氛围、心情等影响而变得相似。","pronunciation":["저념"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速，迅速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"某事达成所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2cfb1cec8339a93ccd39.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74755","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也是。悲伤好像很容易传染给别人。","我只要看到别人哭，就会不知不觉地跟着流泪。","你对我这么好，看来是有什么事情要拜托我吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我只要看到别人哭，就会不知不觉地跟着流泪。","你对我这么好，看来是有什么事情要拜托我吧？","我也是。悲伤好像很容易传染给别人。"],"answer":2}]}
